title: "Live Translation & Subtitles"
abstract: >-
  A Tauri desktop application that produces real-time captions for hybrid and
  in-person conferences. It captures a presenter's microphone, Windows system
  audio from any application, or both, and renders captions in a transparent,
  always-on-top overlay. Two modes are kept deliberately separate: live
  translation into provider-supported target languages via Google Gemini or OpenAI realtime
  speech models, or into English locally via Whisper, and same-language subtitles locally via
  Whisper or through Mistral Voxtral or Google Gemini. Built
  for the workshop "Digital Humanities and Artificial Intelligence in African
  Studies" / "Humanités numériques et intelligence artificielle en études
  africaines" (STIAS, Stellenbosch, 21-24 September 2026).
type: software
